port and speaker identification, Pro plans start at $10/user/month."},{"type":"faq","q":"How does free transcription compare to paid services?","a":"Meetily offers dual transcription engines (Whisper for accuracy, Parakeet for speed) delivering state-of-the-art results. The main difference is that Meetily processes everything locally for complete privacy, while paid services upload your audio to cloud servers."},{"type":"faq","q":"Are there any hidden limits or restrictions?","a":"No hidden limits. You can transcribe unlimited files of any length. There are no daily caps, monthly quotas, or artificial restrictions. The only limit is your computer's processing power."},{"type":"faq","q":"Why is Meetily free when others charge?","a":"Meetily Community Edition is open source (MIT license) and processes locally - no server costs. For individuals, it's free. Pro is available at $10/user/month (billed annually) for advanced features like PDF/DOCX export, speaker identification, and priority support."},{"type":"faq","q":"What audio formats can I transcribe for free?","a":"Meetily supports all common audio formats: MP3, WAV, M4A, FLAC, OGG, AAC, and more. You can also record directly from your microphone or system audio."},{"type":"faq","q":"Is the free transcription accurate?","a":"Yes! Meetily offers dual engines: Whisper for maximum accuracy or Parakeet for speed. Accuracy varies by audio quality, background noise, and accents, but both deliver competitive, state-of-the-art results comparable to paid services."}]}]}]},{"type":"section","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"h2","text":"Get Free Transcription Today"},{"type":"p","text":"Join 599K+ users enjoying unlimited free transcription. Community Edition free, complete privacy."},{"type":"a","text":"Download Free Now","href":"/downloads#community-download"},{"type":"p","text":"Windows & macOS • Open source • Pro from $10/user/month"}]}]}]}]},"links":[{"text":"Skip to main content","href":"#main"},{"text":"Rea